      "Informed Choice certified, per MuscleMeds; the brand appears on Informed Choice's certified-brands page",
      "Dairy-free and lactose-free, labeled Halal; nine flavors on Amazon"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Long ingredient list: maltodextrin, artificial flavors, sucralose, acesulfame potassium and an antifoam blend",
      "Not suitable for a strict carnivore diet despite the name",
      "Creatine and added amino acids sit inside a blend with no amounts listed",
      "Carries a California Prop 65 lead warning on its Amazon listing"
