      "Cost per 25 g": "About $1.11 (Amazon price seen)"
    },
    "amazonUrl": "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004HY325K"
  },
  {
    "id": "carnivor-protein-powder-review-alt-be-well-by-kelly-unflavored",
    "name": "Be Well by Kelly Grass-Finished Beef Protein Powder, Unflavored, 30 Servings",
    "brand": "Be Well by Kelly",
    "badge": "Strict Carnivore-Diet Pick",
    "category": "Grass-fed beef protein isolate, single ingredient",
    "description": "If you searched for a carnivore protein powder because you follow the carnivore diet, this is the closer fit. Per Be Well by Kelly at the time of writing, Unflavored is one ingredient, grass-fed beef protein isolate, with 23 g of protein and 0 g of carbohydrate per scoop and 30 servings per bag. There is no sweetener, flavoring, gum or oil. We found no third-party certification listing for it. At the $51.99 we saw on Amazon, it costs about $1.88 per 25 g of protein.",
    "pros": [
      "One ingredient, per the brand, so it fits a strict carnivore or animal-based diet",
      "23 g of protein per scoop, the same as Carnivor",
      "No sweeteners, flavors, gums or seed oils"
