      "A newer product with far fewer buyer reviews than Carnivor"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The best upgrade for lifters who like Carnivor's protein dose but want natural sweetening.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein / serving": "25 g (listing)",
      "Calories": "About 120",
      "Third-party testing": "Brand states third-party testing",
      "Cost per 25 g": "About $2.00 (Amazon price seen)"
