            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Mixing it in a blender</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Beef isolate foams heavily, and the label warns about it. A blender whips in more air and leaves a thick head of foam. Buyers report better results with cold water in a shaker, powder added after the liquid, a full 8 ounces of water and a minute of rest before drinking.
